  <h4>Razor Leaf &middot; 3lb Beetleweight Vertical Spinner</h4>
  <p>
    The first combat machine I designed completely independently in SOLIDWORKS. Built around a central monolithic Grade 5 titanium spine supporting a vertical spinning disk, Razor Leaf was a masterclass in hybrid composite construction:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Materials Synergy:</strong> Paired CNC-routed carbon fiber side plates with CNC-milled UHMW-PE exterior ablative armor and waterjet-cut titanium wedges.</li>
    <li><strong>Design for Serviceability:</strong> Engineered quick-change modular drive pods allowing complete brushless motor and wheel replacement in under two minutes between tournament rounds.</li>
    <li><strong>Championship Debut:</strong> Captured 1st place in its inaugural tournament outing in summer 2024.</li>
