  <h4>Monster, the Narwhal &middot; 1lb Antweight</h4>
  <p>
    A high-density miniaturization of the Pipeline Punch architecture scaled down to 16 ounces. To solve the persistent failure point of brushless motor rotor magnets fracturing from severe weapon shockwaves, I developed a custom flexible 3D printed TPU shock-absorbing motor adapter that mechanically isolates the rotor from violent radial decelerations.
  </p>

  <h4>Commercial Kit Engineering</h4>
  <p>
    Designed, cost-optimized, and marketed a commercial 3lb 3D printed combat robot kit for collegiate and high-school builders, providing complete wiring schematics, assembly documentation, and bill of materials.
  </p>
